note forbnd benchmark mb-sum (body after a lead line): 20000 passes of a 4096-element ulong sum. The get a i
note in the inner loop is erasable (K 4096 = len 4096). Exit (sum mod 251) is the same with and without bce.
global a ulong 4096
fn main to int
for i ulong 4096
put a i mul i 7
end
s = ulong 0
for r ulong 20000
for i ulong 4096
s = add s get a i
end
end
ret int rem s 251
end
